# GPU stack for training/turtel_grpo.py on the rented 4xH100 (ops/vast/turtel-14b/bootstrap.sh).
# Pins chosen 2026-09-22 from PyPI metadata; none of them has been exercised on a GPU by us yet (UNVERIFIED):
#   trl 1.13.0 (2026-09-10) requires vllm>=0.19.1,<=0.28.0 and transformers>=4.56.2;
#   vllm 0.28.0 (2026-08-26) pins torch==2.13.0 and requires transformers>=5.5.3 -> torch is NOT pinned here,
#   it comes with vllm (the vllm/vllm-openai:v0.28.0 image already has both);
#   transformers 5.16.1 / peft 0.20.0 / accelerate 1.15.0 / datasets 5.0.1 are the newest releases that predate
#   trl 1.13.0 and were verified on CPU by the dry run (torch 2.6.0+cpu, venv-turtel-grpo).
# Loss/advantage/vLLM-server field names (scale_rewards="none", loss_type="grpo", entropy_coef, vllm_mode="server")
# were checked against the trl v1.13.0 sources.
